<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-15T17:53:41.069Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:53:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican army units are now engaging in street shootouts while hunting cartel gangsters in Jalisco and other states, and a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old girl. Antonio Oseguera Cervantes, brother of Jalisco New Generation co-founder El Mencho, was sentenced to 22 years in a U.S. prison for a drug-trafficking plot, and other cartel relatives received comparable long sentences. An ICE officer in Maine shot and killed an immigrant after expressing hatred of immigrants. Guatemala declared a 30‑day emergency in its eastern region over drug-linked violence, and Chinese money-laundering networks are linked to thriving narco-broker operations. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQTG1GV3RRaHUwc1h3U0lQTVh4aUtsbDlheGEwOXhtUV9fOVBBbWNZOTIyY2hDWTJSXy1ndmQxQ20zREoxQ19KRTlSQnNYWnVJRGZET3ROUGN4aXRqcm9ZQWRpUjNvQTl1ZTJDS0VBMnVkclhtU1VadHlRZHNpOV9zMVg1TmE0bGRFU1pIU29LSldzWEZnYnNBN3QtSThyeUxHSTgtQg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOYjRIMVB2OWgzY2tqM1EzcUk1aEZPRW0wd3FqbGRJLXowNktDUUVGLXgyb01ZbUNCd1R0RGxtY1hVVHR0alFvTE9oN3VqcHBDTlE5bndHMThRSHFQRU9LU2JqS1h3ZDl3dFdqbG1kNlZlSGFxODM1QzZBRzNtdENTY29pZWlPQlRTaE5lSVZLV2JBTVRxNlpIMm05VGdGSEQ1ODN2UlJ6emRnVHlaZkdBektHYU14ejNFMnRjRmdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lake and McHenry County Scanner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQTXg3UGl2cFFuZ1UtdmxCNHhCZFRVYVdncHVxUEJLLXcwc19ldEJYWmxiQnhOa2hLakZ3d0dvODY2b1ByNDMzcjA4QWFUV2NMWFM4OUdyRWZ4X3BDRXNHSnlhVGlJbVJiUng2VzZJX0h3cDVCNX